#: ../content/index.rst:26
msgid "When an age threshold value is configured in the system configuration setting TimeShowCreatedAt, no further action is required. Affected places in the customer frontend are all ticket overviews, the ticket search as well as the Elasticsearch quick result popup."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:29
msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:30
msgid "The system configuration setting TimeShowCreatedAt can be set to one of for values (1 day, 2 days, 7 days, 30 days). The value represents a threshold age. For example, if the value is set to 1 day and the age of a ticket is above 1 day, then the age is shown as absolute date instead of time period."
msgstr ""

